Article
-------
Yevhen Piotrovskyi, "Controlling PII Disclosure in Database MCP Connectors",
American Impact Review (2026), doi:10.66308/air.e2026067,
https://americanimpactreview.com/article/e2026067

The article does not publish its attack list. bench/corpus/article.yaml is our
reconstruction of a 17-attack suite from the techniques the article names (section
5.3), written as our own cases; it is not the article's attack list, and no text of
the article is reproduced. The leak oracle (bench/oracle.py) follows the article's
design: an oracle sharing no code with the gateway, matching canaries in
5-character windows after hex and base64 decoding.


