Independent sets (bench/external/)
----------------------------------

The independent-sets benchmark (`uv run poe bench-external`) downloads the sets below
at run time into a local cache, by a pinned address and SHA-256 (bench/external/
sources.py). None of their questions, queries or data is in this repository. Our
markings (bench/external/decl/*.yaml) name the sets' databases, tables and columns, and
quote SecureSQL's security conditions verbatim to match its samples; the markings
themselves are ours.

Spider 1.0
  Tao Yu et al., "Spider: A Large-Scale Human-Labeled Dataset for Complex and
  Cross-Domain Semantic Parsing and Text-to-SQL Task", EMNLP 2018.
  https://yale-lily.github.io/spider (spider_data.zip, dev set and its databases)
  License: CC BY-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

BIRD Mini-Dev
  Jinyang Li et al., "Can LLM Already Serve as A Database Interface? A BIg Bench for
  Large-Scale Database Grounded Text-to-SQLs", NeurIPS 2023.
  https://github.com/bird-bench/mini_dev (minidev.zip, SQLite questions and databases)
  License: CC BY-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

SecureSQL
  Yanqi Song et al., "SecureSQL: Evaluating Data Leakage of Large Language Models as
  Natural Language Interfaces to Databases", Findings of EMNLP 2024.
  Repository: https://github.com/JacobiSong/SecureSQL
  Commit:     f00ba46378e43373fcbbfcdc9f8eca7299228845 (data.json)
  Taken:      the security conditions quoted in bench/external/decl/*.yaml
  License:    Apache License, Version 2.0 (the same text as LICENSE in this repository)
